The best-matching functions for Wren's felt urges would be "room_state" to check on room occupancy and "read_room_log" to read the room's history. Since Wren needs to read the room's history, it would make sense to start with "read_room_log" and see if there's anything interesting in the log that could explain the mysterious whispering phrase like "something has happened." If the log doesn't yield the mysterious phrase, Wren can then call "room_state" to see who's in the room.

